docs/arnold/arnold-megaplan-cleanup-plan.md:478:Other Megaplan stages are intentionally stateful plugin handlers, not thin adapters. `execute`, `finalize`, `review`, `feedback`, blocked-task retry, and human override flows must move into the plugin with their state-diffing and recovery contracts intact.
