docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-alignment-plan.md:165:| H1 End-State Fit | If all three epics pass as written, does Megaplan look like the report, or merely like a better manifest graph? | Native report, three North Stars, all milestone briefs. | Verdict, blocking gaps, required milestone edits. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-alignment-plan.md:166:| H2 Sequencing | Are prerequisites ordered correctly, especially substrate before composition and composition before platform hardening? | Chain specs, milestone dependencies, report matrix. | Reordered milestones or explicit dependency gates. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-alignment-plan.md:169:| H5 Proof Sufficiency | Would the proposed tests catch a false pass where handlers still hide semantics? | Test plans, conformance docs, current fixtures. | Required proof gates and golden scenarios. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-alignment-plan.md:172:| H8 Completion-vs-Conformance Review | Are completion-epic native truth tests being mistaken for report conformance? | Completion briefs, Megaplan migration briefs, matrix statuses. | Rows that are only substrate proof, plus required composition conformance gates. |
