docs/arnold/m5b-plugin-relocation-map.md:43:| **Canonical Target** | `arnold/pipelines/megaplan/review/` |
docs/arnold/m5b-plugin-relocation-map.md:46:| **YAML Row** | `source: megaplan/review` → `target: megaplan/pipelines/megaplan/review` (stale target path in rendered MD) |
docs/arnold/m5b-plugin-relocation-map.md:47:| **Reason** | Megaplan review infrastructure (parallel review, pre-checks, mechanical checks). Imports from `megaplan._core`, `megaplan.prompts.review`, `megaplan.types`, `megaplan.audits.robustness`. No reusable Arnold substrate. |
docs/arnold/m5b-plugin-relocation-map.md:48:| **Key Vocabulary** | `run_parallel_review`, `run_pre_checks`, `mechanical_checks`, `ReviewResult` |
docs/arnold/m5b-plugin-relocation-map.md:59:| **Reason** | Megaplan audit infrastructure (audit engine, capabilities, critique evaluator, hermes vendoring, iteration, robustness, verifiability). Imports from `megaplan._core`, `megaplan.orchestration.verifiability`, `megaplan.types`, `megaplan.store`. |
docs/arnold/m5b-plugin-relocation-map.md:62:| **Note** | `quality_gates.py` has zero megaplan imports — a reusable Arnold substrate candidate — but remains under this directory until the package can be split. |
docs/arnold/m5b-plugin-relocation-map.md:84:├── review/          ← moved from megaplan/review/
