docs/arnold/pipelines/native-python-completion-sense-check-codex.md:18:| E1-Q8 writing-panel gate semantics | MISGUIDED | DeepSeek | Donor code preserves the gate and M2/M3 already name e2e/parity tests; do not add a separate M2 behavioral gate beyond ensuring the existing e2e still runs. |
docs/arnold/pipelines/native-python-completion-sense-check-codex.md:23:| E2-Q5 shared resume contract | PARTIAL | DeepSeek on existence; Claude on gate | Add an Epic 2 exit gate proving `canonical Megaplan`, `writing_panel_strict`, `deliberation`, and `evidence_pack` all route through the shared `arnold.pipeline.resume` / native checkpoint contract, with package-local resume code limited to adapters. |
docs/arnold/pipelines/native-python-completion-sense-check-codex.md:26:| E2-Q8 `evidence_pack` attestation resume | PARTIAL | Both | Add an M4 test/gate that exercises suspend-for-human-review, resume-on-attestation, and final emission through the shared resume contract. |
