docs/arnold/examples/planning-as-composition.md:175:| `bare` | `tiny` | Single-pass, no gate loop. Fastest; for quick drafts. |
docs/arnold/examples/planning-as-composition.md:176:| `light` | — | One critique + revise round, minimal gate criteria. |
docs/arnold/examples/planning-as-composition.md:177:| `full` | `standard` | Standard gate loop (default). Balanced quality/cost. |
docs/arnold/examples/planning-as-composition.md:178:| `thorough` | `robust` | Extended gate loop, stricter criteria, more evaluators. |
