docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:725:- The critique loop and review rework loop are visible as loops.
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:726:- Human gates are suspension calls with reentry ids.
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:729:- Gate retry, critique evaluator retry, and review infrastructure retry are policies at the call site.
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:739:| Decisions / branches | Gate, review, prep, tiebreaker, override. | Yes. | `@decision` in `arnold/pipeline/native/decorators.py:93`; branch pattern in `arnold/patterns/control.py:33`. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:740:| Human suspension | Prep clarification, tiebreaker decide, review human verification, override. | Yes. | Human gate metadata in `@decision` (`arnold/pipeline/native/decorators.py:93`); generic `human_gate()` in `arnold/patterns/control.py:230`; `SuspensionRoute` in `arnold/manifest/manifests.py:216`. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:741:| Bounded loops | Critique/gate/revise and review/rework need caps. | Yes, but awkward. | `LoopPolicy` in `arnold/manifest/manifests.py:87`; loop pattern in `arnold/patterns/control.py:70`; current `revise` loop in `planning.py:191`. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:742:| While-until predicates | Loop should stop on gate pass, cap, no progress, or severity branch. | Partial. | `LoopPolicy.until_ref` exists (`arnold/manifest/manifests.py:91`), but source compiler only accepts `while True` with literal policy (`arnold/workflow/source_compiler.py:1451`). |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:744:| Static parallel fanout | Fixed review panels and fixed critique panels. | Yes. | `parallel()` in `arnold/pipeline/native/decorators.py:177`; `fanout()`/`panel()` in `arnold/patterns/control.py:105`. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:745:| Dynamic parallel map over runtime lists | Critique selected lenses, finalize task batches, review checks. | Missing at source level. | Dynamic fanout exists as imperative runtime machinery, but native `parallel()` requires literal branches (`arnold/pipeline/native/decorators.py:177`). |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:746:| Fan-in / reducer | Merge critique, tiebreaker, review, execution results. | Yes. | Reducer support on `parallel()` (`arnold/pipeline/native/decorators.py:180`); `FanoutPolicy.reducer_ref` (`arnold/manifest/manifests.py:96`). |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:747:| Subworkflow invocation | Critique, gate, tiebreaker, execute, review should be nested workflows. | Yes, manifest-level. | `subpipeline()` in `arnold/patterns/base.py:112`; `SubpipelineRef` in `arnold/manifest/manifests.py:208`. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:748:| Retry policy at call site | Critique evaluator, gate reprompt, review infrastructure, external failures. | Partial. | `RetryPolicy` in `arnold/manifest/manifests.py:78`; `retry()` pattern in `arnold/patterns/control.py:185`; no source-level phase-call retry keyword. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:754:| Resume cursors | Human gates and long-running loops need durable resume. | Exists. | Suspension route support and native runtime resume support; current graph uses reentry ids in `planning.py:194` and `planning.py:219`. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:755:| Dynamic DAG scheduling | Execute tasks need dependency-aware batching over finalized runtime data. | Missing at source/topology level. | Current implementation is inside `execute/batch.py:2278`. |
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:768:- control pattern constructors for branch, loop, fanout, panel, retry, and human gates (`arnold/patterns/control.py:33`);
docs/arnold/megaplan-native-representation-report.md:774:- gate control transitions and suspension routes (`arnold_pipelines/megaplan/workflows/planning.py:141`);
