docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-03-straggler-risk.txt:2662:.megaplan/briefs/astrid-consumer/AR1-consumer-readiness.md:121:C4's acceptance gate + cross-consumer assertions live under the **test tree** (`tests/m8/`, `tests/arnold/`) — they are NOT importable or runnable by an external consumer. Astrid is the 3rd consumer (after megaplan and C4's evidence-pack verifier) and needs to import a conformance suite and run it against its OWN adapter + pipeline to assert it sits correctly on the contract. This part closes AR1: it packages the checks the Part A adapter contract must satisfy.
