docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:693:Runtime and resume bugs can pass ordinary tests while corrupting durable workflow state, so this needs the highest planning tier plus thorough critique.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:706:The reviewer should be able to run discovery/inventory tests and see that every shipped pipeline is authored as `arnold.workflow.Pipeline` or explicitly whitelisted as internal test coverage.
