docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1094:- M1: replace manifest `human gate` wording with “generic suspension/capability route; human gate is a pattern/product capability.” Add content-type fields: `type_id`, `schema_version`, `schema_hash`, retention policy, provenance parent links.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1101:- M6: add final clean-break reaffirmation gate plus installed-wheel negative tests for old imports and console entrypoints before deletion lands.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1105:- Import graph gate: neutral Arnold packages import no `arnold_pipelines.*` or legacy Megaplan.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1106:- Runtime gate: `arnold.execution` imports no `arnold.workflow` / `arnold.patterns`.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1107:- Manifest round-trip gate: compile, serialize, deserialize, run in a separate process.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1108:- Event authority gate: replay derives state/cost/trace/resume only from journal plus artifacts.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1109:- Dispatch gate: `arnold.agent` adapter invoked through neutral capability/effect contract, no product imports.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1110:- Control gate: override/fallback/supervisor cases emit generic control events with product-owned policy handlers.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1111:- Content gate: artifact type/version/schema/provenance/retention validation fails closed.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1112:- Pattern purity gate: all public patterns lower to manifest-compatible data only.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1113:- Installed-wheel gate: new public imports work; deleted imports and old CLIs fail.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave3/w3-02-technical-abstractions.txt:1114:- M5-to-M6 traceability gate: every deleted path is traced to a migrate/delete/whitelist inventory row.
