docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave1/w1-05-megaplan-one.txt:36:4. **Override routing gate**: Force-proceed/abort/escalate preserve exact current routing behavior in parity tests.
docs/arnold/workflow-manifest-runtime-review/subagent-results/wave1/w1-05-megaplan-one.txt:37:5. **Dynamic topology gate**: Build pipeline with three robustness levels; verify graph shape, loop caps, and reviewer counts differ per spec.
