arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/cloud_skill.md:328:10. **Stalled `chain_state` makes a relaunch resume a dead plan (session alive, milestone stuck at "none").** An aborted run leaves `.megaplan/plans/.chains/<spec>-<digest>.json` with `last_state: "stalled"`; the next `cloud chain` resumes it and never starts the milestone. `cloud chain` now auto-clears a stalled-with-no-progress state on fresh launch; if you hit it on an older worker, `rm -rf .megaplan/plans/.chains/* .megaplan/plans/<milestone>-*` (only the stalled ones) and relaunch.
