arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:10:a synthesis editor reconciles their feedback into a revision brief, and a
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:11:revision editor produces the updated draft. A human gate lets you review
