arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:8:A three-round pipeline for rigorous epic critique and revision. Fifteen
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:10:the epic in panels of five. After each panel, a senior reviser adjudicates
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:12:and produces a revised epic. The final readiness stage assesses whether the
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:48:Epic Blitz runs three critique-and-revision rounds, each at a different
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:59:2. **High Revise** — senior reviser adjudicates findings and produces a revised epic.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:63:3. **Mid Panel** (parallel) — five critics review the revised epic:
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:69:4. **Mid Revise** — senior reviser adjudicates findings and produces a further revised epic.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:73:5. **Low Panel** (parallel) — five critics review the revised epic:
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/epic-blitz/SKILL.md:79:6. **Readiness** — terminal reviser produces the final epic and chain-readiness assessment.
