Review is currently a post-execution loop, not a plan-revise loop: `needs_rework` returns to the finalized/execution path, while critique/gate/finalize feedback is what feeds `revise`. I’ll call that out because it matters for where North Star failures should be converted into plan changes versus halt/review actions.
